sequenceDiagram
    participant A
    participant B
    participant C
    par Parallel
        A->>B: hello
    and
        A->>C: hi
    end
    critical Connect
        B-xC: fail
    option Retry
        B->>C: retry
    end
    rect rgb(200, 220, 255)
